      "question": "<p>A curve has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y = \\frac{2}{3}x^3 - \\frac{7}{2}x^2 - 4x + 5\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>(a) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}\"></span> writing your answer in simplest form.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>(b) Hence find the range of values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span> for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\"></span> is decreasing.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p>",
