      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2023-june/q5",
      "question": "<p>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</p><p>Solutions relying on calculator technology are not acceptable.</p><figure class=\"practice-figure\" style=\"max-width:80mm;margin:2mm auto\"><img src=\"resources/exams/edexcel-8ma0-01-2023-june/q05-figure.svg\" alt=\"Figure 2. Shaded region bounded by the curve and axes.\"></figure><p>The finite region <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span>, shown shaded in Figure 2, is bounded by the curve with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y = 4x^2 + 3\"></span>, the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\"></span>-axis and the line with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y = 23\"></span>.</p><p>Show that the exact area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\sqrt{5}\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a rational constant to be found.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p>",
