      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2023-june/q6",
      "question": "<p>The circle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2 + y^2 - 6x + 10y + k = 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a constant.</p><p>(a) Find the coordinates of the centre of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> does not cut or touch the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>-axis,</p><p>(b) find the range of possible values for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
