    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2023-june/q12",
      "question": "<p>In this question you must show detailed reasoning.</p><p>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</p><p>(a) Show that the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4 \\tan x = 5 \\cos x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>can be written as</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"5 \\sin^2 x + 4 \\sin x - 5 = 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(b) Hence solve, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0 &lt; x \\leq 360^\\circ\"></span></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4 \\tan x = 5 \\cos x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>giving your answers to one decimal place.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><p>(c) Hence find the number of solutions of the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4 \\tan 3x = 5 \\cos 3x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>in the interval <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0 &lt; x \\leq 1800^\\circ\"></span>, explaining briefly the reason for your answer.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
