      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2023-june/q13",
      "question": "<p>Relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span></p><ul><li>point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10\\mathbf{i} - 3\\mathbf{j}\"></span></li></ul><ul><li>point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-8\\mathbf{i} + 9\\mathbf{j}\"></span></li></ul><ul><li>point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-2\\mathbf{i} + p\\mathbf{j}\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> is a constant</li></ul><p>(a) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>(b) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\overrightarrow{AB}|\"></span> giving your answer as a fully simplified surd.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>Given that points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A, B\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> lie on a straight line,</p><p>(c) (i) find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>,</p><p>(ii) state the ratio of the area of triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"AOC\"></span> to the area of triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"AOB\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
